    "q-8422": {
      "dom_id": "step-q8422",
      "name": "Question 15",
      "problem": "Given that ${x}_{1}$ and ${x}_{2}$ are the solutions to the equation $\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})=-\\frac{1}{2}$ for $0\\le x<\\pi ,$ what is the value of ${x}_{1}\\cdot {x}_{2}?$",
      "worked_solution": "We will find the general solution to the equation, and then generate all of the solutions in the required domain.\n\nThe general solution to our equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x+\\frac{\\pi }{6} & =-\\frac{2\\pi }{3}+2n\\pi , & \\, & \\, & 2x+\\frac{\\pi }{6} & =\\frac{2\\pi }{3}+2n\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving the two equations above for $x$ gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x & =-\\frac{5\\pi }{6}+2n\\pi  & \\, & \\, & 2x & =\\frac{\\pi }{2}+2n\\pi  \\\\ x & =-\\frac{5\\pi }{12}+n\\pi  & \\, & \\, & x & =\\frac{\\pi }{4}+n\\pi  \\\\ x & =\\frac{(12n-5)\\pi }{12} & \\, & \\, & x & =\\frac{(4n+1)\\pi }{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe set $n=0,\\pm 1,\\pm 2,…,$ until we have generated all solutions in the domain $0\\le x<\\pi .$\n\n- Setting $n=0$ gives $x=-\\frac{5\\pi }{12}$ and $x=\\frac{\\pi }{4}.$ We reject $-\\frac{5\\pi }{12}$ since it lies outside the domain of interest.\n\n- Setting $n=1$ gives $x=\\frac{7\\pi }{12}$ and $x=\\frac{5\\pi }{4}.$ We reject $\\frac{5\\pi }{4}$ since it lies outside the domain of interest.\n\nAll other values of $n$ generate solutions outside the domain $0<x\\le \\pi .$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}\\cdot {x}_{2}=\\frac{\\pi }{4}\\cdot \\frac{7\\pi }{12}=\\frac{7{\\pi }^{2}}{48}.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-8422-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{\\pi }{48}",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"370\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>48</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-8422-b",
